{"id":"183a4a9edeebe744d25c8b28e614ac5d15929266","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245837","title":"Pi Agent 用户有什么必备的配套吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"SilenceLL","excerpt":"程序员 - @SilenceLL - 我现在接了 ChatGPT 的额度，基本是裸奔着的，就自己搞了个微信的扩展，让它能够通过微信指挥干活。另外体感很慢，虽然额度确实比 codex cli 消耗慢不少。目前在用的 cli 工具合集","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>我现在接了 ChatGPT 的额度，基本是裸奔着的，就自己搞了个微信的扩展，让它能够通过微信指挥干活。</p>\n<p>另外体感很慢，虽然额度确实比 codex cli 消耗慢不少。目前在用的 cli 工具合集：codex cli, qodercli, antigravity cli 。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/配套\"><li></li> 配套</a><a href=\"/tag/微信\"><li></li> 微信</a><a href=\"/tag/工具\"><li></li> 工具</a></P><p><span>13 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-01 12:50:03 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142129\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/171d/288e/373046_normal.png?m=1714974897\" alt=\"Maboroshii\" data-uid=\"373046\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Maboroshii\">Maboroshii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:41:22 +08:00\">Sep 30</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>\"packages\": [<br>    \"npm:pi-web-access\",<br>    \"npm:@pi-unipi/notify\",<br>    \"npm:@ff-labs/pi-fff\",<br>    \"npm:pi-hashline-edit-pro\",<br>    \"npm:pi-token-speed\"<br>  ],</p><p>我装了这些，感觉挺够用的。之前还有个 mcp 插件，不过今天 pi 内置 mcp 支持了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d4c1ac6ca3b1fe9a9aa85c27fcf01a60?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"NaganoMei\" data-uid=\"489809\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NaganoMei\">NaganoMei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 16:21:26 +08:00\">23h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/knightdf\">knightdf</a> 一直很好奇 就是 omp 不是内置了 exa 搜索 我之前没印象配置过 exa 他的这个 exa 搜索是无限且免费的吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142955\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/da3f94c058238983273c17a6f71f8d3f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"crocoii\" data-uid=\"349664\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/crocoii\">crocoii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 20:17:09 +08:00\">20h 4m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>askuser,todo,subagent,webaccess</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143146\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b198446b72d1e5a3b0090f106a75f3c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sampeng\" data-uid=\"19005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 22:31:33 +08:00\">17h 49m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有，一个改善自我的心。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n    